# Pin LF in the working tree on every OS: Biome checks formatting byte for byte,
# and Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn every file CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg binary
bench/fixtures/** linguist-generated
bench/recordings/** linguist-generated
plugins/webular/dist/** linguist-generated
bun.lock linguist-generated
mise.lock linguist-generated
docs/** linguist-documentation
